==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|pfanne}}, from {{inh|de|goh|phanna}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*pannā}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*pannǭ}}, from {{der|de|LL.|panna}}, from {{der|de|la|patina||bowl, platter}}. {{doublet|de|Patina}}.

